1005
01:01:24,320 --> 01:01:25,650
Because I was not forgiven.

1006
01:01:46,840 --> 01:01:48,710
I forgive your sins.

1007
01:01:54,480 --> 01:01:56,050
I forgive your sins.

1008
01:02:05,430 --> 01:02:06,430
