1015
01:02:30,850 --> 01:02:33,490
She probably forgave you already. You just did not hear it.

1016
01:02:34,490 --> 01:02:37,930
So stop feeling sorry for that kiddo.

1017
01:02:38,060 --> 01:02:40,230
Because I forgave you on her behalf.

1018
01:02:40,900 --> 01:02:43,430
Therefore, you owe me one.

1019
01:02:43,560 --> 01:02:46,570
- So from now on, if it is for me... - Do you...

1020
